there are comments that say "don't touch this,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:16.880
it breaks everything, we don't know&nbsp;
why". Now, no one knows how it works.

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:20.720
People have tried to modernize it,&nbsp;
with ChatGPT or CoPilot, and… nothing's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:26.560
worked. So you just… keep using the build&nbsp;
that's held together by duct tape. That's&nbsp;&nbsp;

